                                        <p>The full Premier League schedule for the 2026-27 season is here. </p><p>Let’s do this. </p><p><b>MORE</b> — <span class="LinkEnhancement"><a class="Link" href="https://www.nbcsports.com/soccer/news/premier-league-transfers-for-summer-2026-list-of-every-in-and-out-for-each-club">Latest Premier League summer transfers for all 20 clubs</a></span></p><h2>How can you watch all 380 Premier League games during the 2026-27 season? </h2><p>In the USA you can watch all 380 Premier League games during the 2026-27 season across <span class="LinkEnhancement"><a class="Link" href="https://www.nbcsports.com/watch/schedule" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NBC</a></span>, <span class="LinkEnhancement"><a class="Link" href="https://www.usanetwork.com/live" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a></span> and <span class="LinkEnhancement"><a class="Link" href="https://www.peacocktv.com/sports/premier-league?cid=2101sportsplsymedi1959&amp;utm_campaign=2101sportspl&amp;utm_source=nbcsports&amp;utm_medium=sym_editorial_seoopt_article&amp;utm_term=nbcsportsseo&amp;utm_content=premierleague" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Peacock.</a></span></p>
